  "description": "The Aim Allroad shares many of its features with our most sophisticated frames. Internal cable routing keeps gear shifting smooth, reduces maintenance and looks great too. Advanced Mechanical Forming allows our engineers to make a stiff, light, cross-ovalised down tube for maximum efficiency and precise steering. Rack mounts make it easy to add luggage carrying to the list of the Aim Allroad's capabilities. And, of course, we used our renowned Agile Ride Geometry to create a bike that's stable when you need it and inspiring when you want it. Topped off with several layers of paint to keep it looking good for years to come, it's a bike you'll be proud of.",
